> Robert

RA81 User Guide (EK-0RA81-UG-001) says:
Left is unlock.
Use a screwdriver to push in on the latch behind the centre slot in the
front bezel. (Look at centre of the row of air holes across front of drive).
RS232 diagnostic terminal connector is under the logic access lid on right
hand side.

If your just moving the drives within the same room just be careful of the
weight.

If your shipping across country then there are shipping brackets, belt
tensioner, foam blocks between boards, etc. Suggest this is time to peer at
the manual.

Regards,
Garry




