the get-go. I believe the expression reflects the daunting problems CPQ
had with EV6. Recall that EV6 was nearly two years late because of
problems encountered making out-of-order execution work properly.

IBM's Power4--an impressive piece of work in its own right--was similarly,
albeit more briefly--delayed because of the "OOE Knothole."



