Paraphrasing from the insert in a TK50 cartridge:

Orange on means write protected (or TK50 cartridge)
Yellow on means loaded/not in motion, off not loaded,
	blinking loaded in motion
Green on means OK to operate handle, off don't,
	blinking means defective cartridge - remove
All three blinking means drive fault, try to reset by
	pressing unload button, if no help, call service.

