> same rack as the system?

I don't have any part numbers to hand.
The cables with metal connectors attached
are obviously intended for external use
(i.e. cab-to-cab). The internal connectors
for, say, a KDA50 to the internal drives
have the KDA50 end (flat squarish push-fit
connector) and four trailing ends for
the drives: these are 8-way (??)
push-fit connectors that go right into
the RA7x drive. There is also a ground
connector to go with each cable.

I forgot to look up the part number.
I'll make a real effort to forget
on Thursday too :-) but if noone
else confirms your numbers, mail
me on Friday!

